    slug: "medical-abortion-pills-india-2026",
    title: "Medical Abortion Pills in India 2026 — How They Work, Cost, Safety",
    excerpt: "Medical Abortion Pills in India 2026 — How They Work, Cost, Safety — Expert guide with costs, legal information, doctor insights, and free consultation.",
