    body: "Choosing the right doctor for MTP is the most important decision for your safety and wellbeing. Here is a complete guide.\n\nWho Is Qualified to Perform MTP in India?\n\nMTP must be performed by a Registered Medical Practitioner (RMP) with a recognised medical degree in gynaecology and obstetrics (MD or MS OBG or DGO). The procedure must be performed at a facility registered under the MTP Act (government hospital or approved private facility).\n\nWhat to Look For in an MTP Doctor\n\nRegistration: Check that the doctor is registered with their State Medical Council. Qualifications: MD (OBG), MS (OBG), or DGO with experience in MTP procedures. Confidentiality: The doctor must maintain complete confidentiality as required by law. Pre-procedure ultrasound: Any doctor who does not insist on an ultrasound before abortion pills should be avoided. Female doctor: If you prefer a female doctor MySurgery always arranges this.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588807050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588807050\n\nRed Flags to Avoid\n\nDoctors who offer MTP over the phone without examination. Anyone prescribing abortion pills without an ultrasound. Unregistered practitioners or quacks. Clinics that ask for your husband's presence or permission. Anyone who judges you or makes you feel shamed.\n\nExpert Doctor for This Procedure\\n\\nDr. Geeta Chadha (MS (OBG), FICOG) — 24 years of experience — practices at Max Hospital, Delhi. Call MySurgery at 8588807050 to book a consultation with Dr. Geeta Chadha or a similar expert in your city.\n\nHow MySurgery Verifies Doctors\n\nMySurgery only partners with doctors who are registered with their State Medical Council, have at least 10 years of experience in gynaecology, work at facilities registered under the MTP Act, follow confidentiality protocols strictly, and have demonstrated commitment to non-judgmental patient care.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588807050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588807050\n\nQuestions to Ask Your MTP Doctor\n\nAre you registered under the MTP Act? Will you perform an ultrasound before the procedure? What is included in the cost? What happens if the abortion is incomplete? Will you maintain complete confidentiality? Can I see a female doctor?\n\nMySurgery's doctors are pre-screened and these standards are already met. Call us at 8588807050 and we will connect you with the right doctor in your city.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588807050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588807050",
