    body: "ZSR (Zing Surgical Ring) circumcision is one of the most popular modern circumcision techniques in India. Here is everything you need to know.\n\nWhat Is ZSR Circumcision?\n\nZSR circumcision uses a circular surgical stapling device that cuts the foreskin and applies dissolving staples simultaneously in a single circular motion. The procedure is extremely fast (10 to 15 minutes), produces a uniform and aesthetically pleasing result, and does not require general anaesthesia. The staples dissolve on their own within 7 to 10 days.\n\nZSR Circumcision vs Laser Circumcision\n\nZSR is faster (10 to 15 minutes vs 20 to 25 minutes for laser). ZSR uses dissolving staples while laser uses no stitches at all. Both techniques have excellent results and very low complication rates. Laser is marginally more precise with slightly better cosmetic outcomes. ZSR is slightly more affordable.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588807050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588807050\n\nZSR Circumcision Cost in India 2026\n\nDelhi: Rs 16,000 to Rs 38,000. Gurugram: Rs 18,000 to Rs 40,000. Mumbai: Rs 18,000 to Rs 42,000. Bangalore: Rs 16,000 to Rs 38,000. Chennai: Rs 15,000 to Rs 36,000. Kochi: Rs 15,000 to Rs 35,000. Tier-2 cities (Lucknow, Indore, Patna): Rs 12,000 to Rs 28,000.\n\nExpert Doctor for This Procedure\\n\\nDr. Amit Khanna (MCh (Urology), Fellowship Andrology) — 14 years of experience — practices at Jaypee Hospital, Noida. Call MySurgery at 8588807050 to book a consultation with Dr. Amit Khanna or a similar expert in your city.\n\nBenefits of ZSR Circumcision\n\nFastest technique — 10 to 15 minutes. Local anaesthesia — no general anaesthesia needed. No bleeding — stapler controls bleeding completely. Uniform result — precise circular cut. Same-day discharge. Return to work in 2 to 3 days. Dissolving staples — no removal needed.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588807050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588807050\n\nWho Is ZSR Circumcision Best For?\n\nZSR is ideal for adults who want the fastest possible procedure with excellent results. It is also very suitable for children's circumcision as the speed reduces anaesthesia exposure time. It is particularly popular for religious circumcision where large volumes need to be done efficiently.\n\nCall MySurgery at 8588807050 to book a confidential ZSR circumcision consultation with an experienced urologist in your city.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588807050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588807050",
