    body: 'Many men considering adult circumcision are unsure of what to expect. Here is a complete step-by-step guide to the entire experience.\n\nBefore the Procedure — Consultation\n\nYou will have a consultation with a urologist who will examine your foreskin, understand your reason for circumcision (medical or personal preference), explain the technique options (laser vs ZSR vs conventional), answer all your questions, and give you pre-operative instructions.\n\nPre-operative Instructions\n\nAvoid eating or drinking for 4 hours before the procedure. Wash and clean the area thoroughly the morning of the procedure. Wear comfortable loose clothing. Arrange for someone to drive you home (not strictly necessary but recommended).\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588807050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588807050\n\nOn the Day of Procedure\n\nYou will arrive at the hospital or clinic. Pre-operative paperwork and consent is completed. Local anaesthesia cream or injection is applied — you feel a brief sting from the injection and then no pain. The procedure takes 20 to 30 minutes. You are awake and comfortable throughout. A dressing is applied. You rest for 30 to 60 minutes and then go home the same day.\n\nExpert Doctor for This Procedure\\n\\nDr. Rajan Menon (MCh (Urology)) — 20 years of experience — practices at Amrita Hospital, Kochi. Call MySurgery at 8588807050 to book a consultation with Dr. Rajan Menon or a similar expert in your city.\n\nDay 1 to 3 After Circumcision\n\nMild to moderate swelling and soreness — this is completely normal. Take prescribed painkillers regularly for the first 2 days. Keep the area clean and dry. Change the dressing as instructed. Wear supportive underwear (not tight but supportive). Return to desk work is possible for most people on day 2 to 3.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588807050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588807050\n\nWeek 1 to 3 After Circumcision\n\nSwelling gradually reduces. Laser: the wound heals cleanly without stitches or staples. ZSR: the dissolving staples start to fall off at 7 to 10 days — do not pull them off, allow them to dissolve naturally. Avoid tight trousers. Avoid sports and gym for 2 weeks. Avoid swimming for 3 weeks.\n\nWeek 4 to 6\n\nFull healing is typically complete by 4 to 6 weeks. Sexual activity can be resumed once the wound is fully healed — your urologist will advise. The final aesthetic result is visible by 6 weeks.\n\n\\n\\nSpeaking to an expert is completely free and confidential. Call MySurgery at 8588807050 or WhatsApp us to connect with an experienced doctor in your city within 30 minutes.\\n\\nBook Free Consultation: mysurgery.in/contact | WhatsApp: wa.me/918588807050',
